      {
        "label": "Climate driver",
        "value": "Strengthening El Ni\u00f1o",
        "detail": "In its 10 September 2026 advisory, NOAA put the chance of a very strong El Ni\u00f1o at more than 90% during late 2026 and early 2027. This is a forecast of El Ni\u00f1o strength, not Nairobi flood probability."
